  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support &#x201C;Ihushi Development Project&#x201D; through Friendship with Ihushi. The project focus has been to support Ihushi Development Centre (IDC) for the benefit of the people in the Tanzanian villages Ihushi, Sese and Matale with a population of around 13,400 people, It aimed at making IDC a resource centre for sustainable development plus developing capacities of the youth and women in the villages.</narrative>
  </description>
